Magic resistance protects against many pure-magical (as opposed to
elemental, for example) effects and ranged attacks. Magic cancellation
provides protection against most special monster _melee_ attacks.

(The only thing that could fall into both categories is Death's deadly
touch; that's too strong to be cancelled, though, while it is
ameliorated by magic resistance.)

